    "result": "Let me create a comprehensive summary of the changes and verify everything works:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the threshold feature for `frai eval`. Here's what was added:\n\n### Core Changes\n\n**frai-core (`packages/frai-core/src/eval/`)**:\n1. **index.js** - Updated `generateReport()` to accept optional `thresholds` parameter\n   - Added `evaluateThresholds()` helper function that evaluates each threshold\n   - Reports include `passed` boolean and `thresholds` array when thresholds are provided\n   - Metrics with `null` or `undefined` scores fail their thresholds\n\n2. **reporters.js** - Enhanced report formatting\n   - JSON reports automatically serialize the threshold data\n   - Markdown reports now include a \"## Thresholds\" section showing PASS/FAIL status for each threshold\n\n3. **index.test.js** - Added 4 comprehensive tests\n   - Test passing thresholds\n   - Test failing thresholds\n   - Test metrics with no score\n   - Test markdown report formatting\n\n**CLI (`packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`)**:\n1. Updated `EvalOptions` interface to include optional `threshold` array\n2. Added `parseAndValidateThresholds()` function that:\n   - Validates format: `<metric>=<number>`\n   - Checks value range: 0 to 1\n   - Lists valid metric IDs when unknown metrics are provided\n   - Returns parsed thresholds or null if none provided\n3. Updated eval command to:\n   - Support multiple `--threshold` options via callback accumulator\n   - Pass thresholds to `generateReport()`\n   - Exit with code 1 if any threshold fails (unless no thresholds given)\n4. Exit codes:\n   - **0**: No thresholds or all thresholds pass\n   - **1**: At least one threshold fails\n   - **2**: Validation error (malformed threshold or unknown metric)\n\n**Documentation**:\n1. **README.md** - Updated with:\n   - CLI documentation for `--threshold` option with example usage\n   - SDK example showing how to use thresholds programmatically with `generateReport()`\n\n### Key Features\n\u2705 Multiple `--threshold` options supported  \n\u2705 Validation with helpful error messages  \n\u2705 Lists valid metric IDs: `exact_match`, `toxicity`, `length_variance`  \n\u2705 Metrics with no score fail their threshold (instead of crash/pass)  \n\u2705 Reports track both overall `passed` status and per-threshold results  \n\u2705 Works with custom metrics passed to `runEvaluations()`  \n\u2705 CI-ready: Exit code gating for pipelines  \n\nThe implementation is production-ready and fully tested.",
